#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:2
msgid "Site support"
msgstr "站点支持"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:4
msgid ""
"Read the Docs offers support for projects on our :doc:`Read the Docs "
"Business </commercial/index>` and |org_brand| platforms. We're happy to "
"assist with any questions or problems you have using either of our "
"platforms."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 为 :doc:`Read the Docs Business </commercial/index>` 和 "
"|org_brand| 平台上的项目提供支持。使用我们任一平台时遇到的问题，我们都乐于协助。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:8
msgid ""
"Read the Docs does not offer support for questions or problems with "
"documentation tools or content. If you have a question or problem using a "
"particular documentation tool, you should refer to :ref:`external resources "
"<support:External resources>` for help instead."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 不提供关于文档工具或内容的问题支持。若你在使用某款文档工具时遇到问题，请参阅 :ref:`外部资源 "
"<support:External resources>` 获取帮助。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:12
msgid "Some examples of requests that we support are:"
msgstr "我们支持的请求示例包括："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:14
msgid ""
"\"How do I transfer ownership of a Read the Docs project to another "
"maintainer?\""
msgstr "\"如何将 Read the Docs 项目的所有权转移给另一位维护者？\""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:15
msgid "\"Why are my project builds being cancelled automatically?\""
msgstr "\"为什么我的项目构建被自动取消？\""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:16
msgid "\"How do I manage my subscription?\""
msgstr "\"如何管理我的订阅？\""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:18
msgid ""
"You might also find the answers you are looking for in our "
":doc:`documentation guides </guides/index>`. These provide step-by-step "
"solutions to common user requests."
msgstr "你可能也在我们的 :doc:`文档指南 </guides/index>` 中找到所需答案。这些指南为常见用户需求提供分步解决方案。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:23
msgid "|com_brand|"
msgstr "|com_brand|"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:25
msgid "Please fill out the form at https://app.readthedocs.com/support/."
msgstr "请填写 https://app.readthedocs.com/support/ 上的表单。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:27
msgid ""
"Our team responds to support requests within 2 business days or earlier for "
"most plans. Faster support response times and support SLAs are available "
"with plan upgrades."
msgstr "对大多数套餐，我们的团队会在 2 个工作日内或更早响应支持请求。升级套餐可获得更快的支持响应时间和支持 SLA。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:30
msgid ""
"If you are unable to create or access your account, you can email us at "
"support@readthedocs.com."
msgstr "若你无法创建或访问账户，可发邮件至 support@readthedocs.com。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:32
msgid "|org_brand|"
msgstr "|org_brand|"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:34
msgid ""
"Please fill out the form at https://app.readthedocs.org/support/, and we "
"will reply as soon as possible."
msgstr "请填写 https://app.readthedocs.org/support/ 上的表单，我们会尽快回复。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:37
msgid ""
"If you are unable to create or access your account, you can email us at "
"support@readthedocs.org."
msgstr "若你无法创建或访问账户，可发邮件至 support@readthedocs.org。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:40
msgid "External resources"
msgstr "外部资源"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:42
msgid ""
"If you have questions about how to use a documentation tool or authoring "
"content for your project, or have an issue that isn't related to a bug with "
"Read the Docs, `Stack Overflow`_ is the best place for your question."
msgstr "若你对如何使用文档工具或为项目编写内容有疑问，或遇到的问题并非 Read the Docs 的缺陷，`Stack Overflow`_ 是提问的最佳场所。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:46
msgid "Examples of good questions for Stack Overflow are:"
msgstr "适合在 Stack Overflow 提问的例子包括："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:48
msgid "\"What is the best way to structure the table of contents across a project?\""
msgstr "\"在项目中组织目录的最佳方式是什么？\""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:49
msgid ""
"\"How do I structure translations inside of my project for easiest "
"contribution from users?\""
msgstr "\"如何在项目内组织翻译以便用户最容易参与贡献？\""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:50
msgid ""
"\"How do I use Sphinx to use SVG images in HTML output but PNG in PDF "
"output?\""
msgstr "\"如何用 Sphinx 让 HTML 输出使用 SVG 图片而 PDF 输出使用 PNG？\""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:53
msgid "Tag questions with ``read-the-docs`` so other folks can find them easily."
msgstr "为提问添加 ``read-the-docs`` 标签，方便他人查找。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:56
msgid "Bug reports"
msgstr "缺陷报告"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/support.rst:58
msgid ""
"If you have an issue with the actual functioning of Read the Docs, you can "
"file bug reports on our `GitHub issue tracker`_. You can also "
":doc:`contribute changes and fixes <rtd-dev:contribute>` to Read the Docs, "
"as the code is open source."
msgstr ""
"若 Read the Docs 实际功能存在问题，可在我们的 `GitHub issue tracker`_ 上提交缺陷报告。由于代码开源，你也可以 "
":doc:`贡献更改和修复 <rtd-dev:contribute>` 。"

